%% 04 · Build phase — Voice → Bundle; rehearsal on demand
flowchart TD
  N7["Since 2026-09-04: AUTHOR, DECK and FAQ run at Configure (before Align); BUILD = voice (narration + FAQ answers + filler lines) → bundle (slides with audio joined by line id, timeline, fillers, faq, image map)"]:::data
  GO["POST /api/demos/id/build<br/>[FUNCTION] all6 approvals + fresh observed reasoning/selected-speech readiness<br/>explicit operator override logged; mock bypass"]:::fn
  AUTH["Final spoken delivery of the Planner outline<br/>[AGENT · configured text tier · author.py]<br/>in: plan goals/notes, approved registry, supplied visuals, voice, language/audience<br/>shared grounding + AUTHOR_CRAFT; no second PITCH_SHAPE or PROOF_BLOCK<br/>same segment ids/roles/order; connected speech; checkin = closing statement, no question<br/>deeper, closing + 23–28 word Explore overview led by first supported fundamental"]:::agent
  VAL["Grounding and supported narration target<br/>[FUNCTION · author.validate]<br/>existing citation/visual/speech rules; whole-stop word budgets<br/>every Author run prepares global distinct eligible word target<br/>existing repair plus at most one focused completion attempt<br/>complete lines/batches retain46/48/44word role ceilings; closing45<br/>legacy validator unchanged; missing evidence never permits padding"]:::fn
  ISS{"issues > 0?"}:::dec
  FIX["one local rewrite<br/>[AGENT · configured text tier]<br/>in: full draft + specific issues; preserve unaffected grounded lines, plan structure and visual subjects<br/>out: full script, revalidated under the same evidence rules"]:::agent
  VAL2["Revalidate and finish supported narration automatically<br/>[AGENT + FUNCTION · author.run / narration.preparation_status]<br/>if still short and capacity permits: at most one focused completion<br/>same assigned facts and complete thoughts; no padding or slower voice<br/>remaining deficit or drafting failure stays explicit; no source-gap guess"]:::fn
  IDS["assign stable line ids<br/>[FUNCTION]<br/>out: seg-L1.. plus closing ids"]:::fn
  VAUD["visual-proof audit<br/>[AGENT · Gemini 3.6 Flash]<br/>in: real uploaded pixels in batches ≤12 + every scripted line<br/>out: every image's visible features/limits + every line full/partial/none/not_visual"]:::agent
  VGATE["accept audit only when complete<br/>[FUNCTION · visuals.py]<br/>all line ids + all image refs required; full coverage may bind image<br/>partial/missing visible feature → no proof binding<br/>No pixel decision → retain draft refs/none; record tag proposals only<br/>draft choices stay unaudited; Deck proxy never changes coverage"]:::fn
  AUDIT["visual-audit.json<br/>[DATA]<br/>line reasons, image feature inventory, missing features, changes"]:::data
  TIMING["Whole-line splitting and content timeline<br/>[FUNCTION · author.split_long_batches / timeline]<br/>prepared stops split at role ceiling; complete lines and unique IDs<br/>continuations retain source-stop identity and share original budget<br/>estimates stay labelled; actual audio determines publication duration"]:::fn
  SJ["script.json<br/>[DATA] visual refs + audit summary · version++<br/>preparation status, counts, attempts and drafting errors"]:::data
  DREADY{"Draft prepared?<br/>[FUNCTION · graph.after_script]<br/>current supported content target or matching sufficient recordings"}:::dec
  DRAFTWAIT["Keep Author pending; skip paid Deck generation<br/>[FUNCTION · graph / orchestrator]<br/>FAQ then Align; Script approval blocked, other cards reviewable<br/>no approved facts → source request; writer failure → Retry draft<br/>mock placeholders never described as customer-ready narration"]:::fn
  DPIC["one slide per segment · up to two pictures<br/>[FUNCTION · deck.choose_media / choose_proxy]<br/>first two distinct verified image refs with full audit coverage; absent audit accepts Author binding<br/>save first from_line; no qualifying ref → trusted matching part (≥0.6) else hero<br/>proxy marked illustration, with reason; never written into visual audit"]:::fn
  DCALL["titles + picture-owned callouts<br/>[AGENT · Gemini → Claude → Runware text tier · deck.DeckOut]<br/>in: lines, fact ids and each picture's parts; approved registry<br/>out: ≤6-word title, ≤3 callouts per picture of ≤8 words, with image_id and citations<br/>proxy additionally gets a derived cited fact label"]:::agent
  DVAL["the script-line rule on every callout<br/>[FUNCTION · author.ungrounded]<br/>uncited figure/claim, > 8 words, unlisted part → dropped; a slide left empty gets its own cited facts (claim: value)"]:::fn
  DLAY["layout within the owning picture<br/>[FUNCTION · deck.place_callouts]<br/>trusted part confidence ≥0.6 → box anchor and clear label position; otherwise that picture's panel<br/>label_pos fractions belong to that picture, never the whole slide"]:::fn
  DOVR["deck-overrides.json (from Align)<br/>[DATA] up to two allowed media entries; picker per picture; title / cited text / per-picture label edits<br/>API rejects unknown/excluded pictures or >2 entries; validated overrides win"]:::data
  DJ["deck.json<br/>[DATA] media[{image_id,from_line,proxy,proxy_reason}] + callout.image_id<br/>legacy image_id = first picture; version++ · method model|derived"]:::data
  PROV{"tts provider chain?<br/>[FUNCTION · voice.provider_chain]<br/>locked: configured provider only<br/>unlocked: sarvam → gemini → gcloud → browser (no key)"}:::dec
  TTS["render every line (main language)<br/>[LIBRARY · Sarvam Bulbul v3 / Gemini TTS / Cloud TTS]<br/>cache key sha1(provider|voice|lang|text) → audio/*.wav|mp3<br/>VOICE_WORKERS=3 · cache checked before circuit<br/>locked: matching provider/speaker clips only; no alternate voice<br/>Sarvam starts paced at 2.1s; 429-only retry ≤3 attempts, bounded wait, Retry-After honored<br/>partial audio checkpointed; any missing required narration/FAQ/filler stops Build<br/>policy refusal is not retried or routed around"]:::data
  MEASURE["Refresh durations from recorded audio<br/>[FUNCTION · author.timeline via voice.py]<br/>retain planned seconds and planned total; measure WAV duration where present<br/>legacy exact means any measured main line; incomplete/mixed coverage stays labelled<br/>Align compares planned / recorded or estimated time with pitch_minutes"]:::fn
  BROWSER["voice_provider=browser<br/>[term] player speaks with Web Speech"]:::term
  LANGS{"settings.languages<br/>has extra languages?"}:::dec
  TRANS["translate script per extra language<br/>[AGENT · configured text tier · translate.py · stage 'translate']<br/>in: segments/closing/intake text only · out: same ids, translated text · skipped when source digest unchanged → script.&lt;lang&gt;.json"]:::agent
  TTS2["render every translated line<br/>[LIBRARY · same chain, lang override]"]:::data
  REHEARSE["Run rehearsal · explicit operator action<br/>[ASK · POST /api/demos/id/rehearsal]<br/>serialized with Read/Build/revise; ready status and publication retained"]:::ask
  QBANK{"Any non-rejected saved questions?<br/>[FUNCTION · rehearsal.run]<br/>customer questions first, then uploaded document questions"}:::dec
  QGEN["At most five sample questions, only for an empty bank<br/>[AGENT · configured text tier · generate_questions]<br/>no generated FAQ quota; no automatic call during Read/Build"]:::agent
  QA["Answer sample or stale-registry questions afresh<br/>[AGENT + FUNCTION · qa.answer]<br/>voice_it=false, learn=false; current approved evidence<br/>current eligible bank answers reused; no facts or customer questions invented"]:::agent
  COV["Coverage + gaps<br/>[FUNCTION] → rehearsal.json<br/>diagnostics only; published bundle and approvals unchanged"]:::fn
  SCORE["Demo scorecard<br/>[AGENT · configured text tier · judge]<br/>reuse by semantic script/fact/FAQ/prompt hash; count/audio-only changes ignored<br/>out: 10 criteria ×0–2 + gaps; prompt score is not a live acceptance test"]:::agent
  BUN["bundle.build<br/>[FUNCTION · bundle.py]<br/>in: demo, understanding, plan, script, deck (+ language variants)<br/>out: media URLs + picture-owned callouts; retain first image_url and existing line-audio joins<br/>renderer: native-fit halves at ≥700px, stacked below; line reveal activates matching picture<br/>proxy illustration badge; CTAs, facts, languages and version retained"]:::fn
  APPROVAL{"All six approvals still current?<br/>[FUNCTION · shared per-demo publication lock]<br/>serialize input reads and final writes with customer FAQ changes"}:::dec
  REALIGN["Return to Align; preserve published bundle/version<br/>[HUMAN] review changed cards before another Build"]:::ask
  MINIMUM{"Publishable default narration in every language?<br/>[FUNCTION · narration.require_minimum]<br/>selected1–5minutes (default3) of readable recorded overview/opening + guided main speech + statements + playable closing<br/>exclude film, Q&A, deeper-only and duplicates; estimates cannot pass"}:::dec
  SHORT{"Complete recordings but under the selected duration?<br/>[FUNCTION · graph.bundle]<br/>Bundle pending; previous publication/audio preserved<br/>missing/unreadable clips need recording recovery, not rewriting"}:::dec
  AUTODRAFT["Prepare revised supported narration automatically<br/>[FUNCTION · graph.bundle → author]<br/>same user-requested Build, one bounded authoring pass<br/>entry becomes revise; no second Voice or automatic publication<br/>rebudget from matching recording pace; changed Script/Visuals require review"]:::fn
  DAPP{"All six approvals still current?<br/>[FUNCTION · graph.after_author / after_faq]<br/>automatic revised draft returns to review before Voice"}:::dec
  READY["status ready · durable SSE phase_done build<br/>[DATA · events.json + stage progress/warnings]<br/>fresh subscriber receives current baseline; valid cursor resumes bounded history"]:::term

  GO --> AUTH --> VAL --> ISS
  ISS -- "yes" --> FIX --> VAL2 --> IDS
  ISS -- "no" --> IDS
  IDS --> VAUD --> VGATE --> AUDIT --> TIMING --> SJ
  SJ --> DREADY
  DREADY -- "yes" --> DPIC --> DCALL --> DVAL --> DLAY --> DJ
  DREADY -- "no" --> DRAFTWAIT --> REALIGN
  DOVR -.-> DLAY
  DJ --> DAPP
  DAPP -- "yes" --> PROV
  DAPP -- "changed draft" --> REALIGN
  PROV -- "sarvam / gemini / gcloud" --> TTS --> MEASURE --> LANGS
  PROV -- "browser" --> BROWSER --> BUN
  LANGS -- "yes" --> TRANS --> TTS2 --> BUN
  LANGS -- "no" --> BUN
  BUN --> APPROVAL
  APPROVAL -- "yes, lock held through publication" --> MINIMUM
  APPROVAL -- "changed during Voice or before publication" --> REALIGN
  MINIMUM -- "all measured and selected duration reached" --> READY
  MINIMUM -- "short or missing/unreadable audio" --> SHORT
  SHORT -- "measured shortfall" --> AUTODRAFT --> AUTH
  SHORT -- "missing/unreadable recordings" --> REALIGN
  READY -. "optional, on demand" .-> REHEARSE --> QBANK
  QBANK -- "yes" --> QA
  QBANK -- "no" --> QGEN --> QA
  QA --> COV --> SCORE

  classDef agent fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0b2a5b;
  classDef fn fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#052e16;
  classDef dec fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#2a0a4a;
  classDef term fill:#e5e7eb,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827;
  classDef ask fill:#cffafe,stroke:#0891b2,color:#083344;
  classDef data fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#2a0a4a;
